==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*2 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.
*6 [[Znache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you don't have all of the treasures from [[Empire of Cats]], this stage is going to be extremely difficult for you.

Any anti-zombie units can and most likely will be amazing here, and tankers such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan]] or long ranged units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can help dealing with the traitless teacher bears or Master A a lot easier.

==Hints==
These hints only appear as defeat messages given upon losing the stage.
*Don't underestimate the remains of<br>fallen Zombies... Save Money so you<br>can respond when they end up reviving!
*This is a tough stage to complete without<br>all of the Treasures in Empire of Cats<br>Ch. 1 and 2. Grab 'em if you don't have 'em!

